<https://ontology.local/support#Contact> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An individual person at a customer account who is authorised to raise support tickets and use self-service tools. A Contact is a person in their capacity as a customer representative. Internal staff are modelled as `sup:SupportAgent`, `sup:SalesRepresentative` or `sup:CustomerSuccessManager`." .
<https://ontology.local/support#Contact> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An individual person at a customer account who is authorised to raise support tickets and use self-service tools. A Contact is a person in their capacity as a customer representative. Internal staff are modelled as `sup:SupportAgent`, `sup:SalesRepresentative` or `sup:CustomerSuccessManager`." .
