<https://ontology.local/support#CRM> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "CRM" .
<https://ontology.local/support#CRM> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A customer relationship management system that records tickets. Each distinct CRM instance is a distinct instance of this class, because each carries its own ticket numbering, its own user records, and — critically — its own vocabulary." .
<https://ontology.local/support#CRM> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A customer relationship management system that records tickets. Each distinct CRM instance is a distinct instance of this class, because each carries its own ticket numbering, its own user records, and — critically — its own vocabulary." .
