<https://ontology.local/support#CRM> <https://ontology.local/support#status> "Canonical" .
<https://ontology.local/support#CRM> <https://ontology.local/support#identityRule> "Natural key: the system code (e.g. `SF_EMEA`, `SF_AMER`). Each org is a separate instance even when several orgs run on the same platform, because the ID spaces and the vocabulary do not carry across." .
