<https://ontology.local/support#SupportAgent> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "SupportAgent" .
<https://ontology.local/support#SupportAgent> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An internal member of the support organization who is assigned tickets, resolves them using documentation, and escalates to development when a ticket is caused by a defect or requires new functionality." .
<https://ontology.local/support#SupportAgent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An internal member of the support organization who is assigned tickets, resolves them using documentation, and escalates to development when a ticket is caused by a defect or requires new functionality." .
