<https://ontology.local/support#C-46> <https://ontology.local/support#enforcementLevel> "Soft" .
<https://ontology.local/support#C-46> <https://ontology.local/support#constraintText> "An Account's SalesRepresentative must cover the Account's Region. This is \"assigned depending on the region\" made checkable — and it is the constraint most likely to fail after a territory reshuffle." .
<https://ontology.local/support#C-46> <https://ontology.local/support#status> "Active" .
<https://ontology.local/support#C-47> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
