<https://ontology.local/support#C-47> <https://ontology.local/support#enforcementLevel> "Hard" .
<https://ontology.local/support#C-47> <https://ontology.local/support#constraintText> "An Account has at most one CustomerSuccessManager." .
<https://ontology.local/support#C-47> <https://ontology.local/support#status> "Active" .
