<https://ontology.local/support#C-48> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "C-48" .
<https://ontology.local/support#C-48> <https://ontology.local/support#enforcementLevel> "Hard" .
<https://ontology.local/support#C-48> <https://ontology.local/support#constraintText> "Every Ticket is recorded in exactly one CRM." .
<https://ontology.local/support#C-48> <https://ontology.local/support#status> "Active" .
<https://ontology.local/support#C-49> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://ontology.local/support#C-49> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://ontology.local/support#Constraint> .
<https://ontology.local/support#C-49> <https://ontology.local/support#constraintId> "C-49" .
<https://ontology.local/support#C-49> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "C-49" .
<https://ontology.local/support#C-49> <https://ontology.local/support#enforcementLevel> "Hard" .
<https://ontology.local/support#C-49> <https://ontology.local/support#constraintText> "A fact from a CRM with isAuthoritative = false must not override a fact from an authoritative system for the same property. Mirrors lag." .
<https://ontology.local/support#C-49> <https://ontology.local/support#status> "Active" .
<https://ontology.local/support#C-50> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://ontology.local/support#C-50> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://ontology.local/support#Constraint> .
<https://ontology.local/support#C-50> <https://ontology.local/support#constraintId> "C-50" .
<https://ontology.local/support#C-50> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "C-50" .
<https://ontology.local/support#C-50> <https://ontology.local/support#enforcementLevel> "Hard" .
<https://ontology.local/support#C-50> <https://ontology.local/support#constraintText> "Every CRM declares ticketTermUsed. A system whose vocabulary is unknown cannot have its records safely translated." .
<https://ontology.local/support#C-50> <https://ontology.local/support#status> "Active" .
<https://ontology.local/support#C-51> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://ontology.local/support#C-51> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://ontology.local/support#Constraint> .
<https://ontology.local/support#C-51> <https://ontology.local/support#constraintId> "C-51" .
<https://ontology.local/support#C-51> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "C-51" .
<https://ontology.local/support#C-51> <https://ontology.local/support#enforcementLevel> "Hard" .
<https://ontology.local/support#C-51> <https://ontology.local/support#constraintText> "Every Product declares usesPlatinumNaming and severityTermUsed. A product whose support vocabulary is unknown cannot have its tickets safely compared against another product's." .
<https://ontology.local/support#C-51> <https://ontology.local/support#status> "Active" .
<https://ontology.local/support#C-52> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://ontology.local/support#C-52> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://ontology.local/support#Constraint> .
<https://ontology.local/support#C-52> <https://ontology.local/support#constraintId> "C-52" .
<https://ontology.local/support#C-52> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "C-52" .
<https://ontology.local/support#C-52> <https://ontology.local/support#enforcementLevel> "Hard" .
<https://ontology.local/support#C-52> <https://ontology.local/support#constraintText> "SupportAgent, SalesRepresentative and CustomerSuccessManager are pairwise disjoint. These are three distinct jobs in the support and commercial organization." .
<https://ontology.local/support#C-52> <https://ontology.local/support#status> "Active" .
<https://ontology.local/support#C-53> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://ontology.local/support#C-53> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://ontology.local/support#Constraint> .
<https://ontology.local/support#C-53> <https://ontology.local/support#constraintId> "C-53" .
<https://ontology.local/support#C-53> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "C-53" .
<https://ontology.local/support#C-53> <https://ontology.local/support#enforcementLevel> "Hard" .
<https://ontology.local/support#C-53> <https://ontology.local/support#constraintText> "Every License is bound to exactly one SupportEntitlement." .
<https://ontology.local/support#C-53> <https://ontology.local/support#status> "Active" .
<https://ontology.local/support#C-54> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://ontology.local/support#C-54> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://ontology.local/support#Constraint> .
<https://ontology.local/support#C-54> <https://ontology.local/support#constraintId> "C-54" .
<https://ontology.local/support#C-54> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "C-54" .
<https://ontology.local/support#C-54> <https://ontology.local/support#enforcementLevel> "Soft" .
<https://ontology.local/support#C-54> <https://ontology.local/support#constraintText> "A License's SupportEntitlement should match its Account's SupportEntitlement." .
<https://ontology.local/support#C-54> <https://ontology.local/support#status> "Active" .
<https://ontology.local/support#C-54> <https://ontology.local/support#constraintNote> "The model's own open question, made checkable. If accounts routinely hold licenses at different tiers, entitlement belongs on the license and C-02 is wrong. Flagging rather than rejecting means the first real violation tells us which model is right, instead of the data being quietly reshaped to fit our guess. See OQ-42." .
<https://ontology.local/support#C-55> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://ontology.local/support#C-55> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://ontology.local/support#Constraint> .
<https://ontology.local/support#C-55> <https://ontology.local/support#constraintId> "C-55" .
<https://ontology.local/support#C-55> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "C-55" .
<https://ontology.local/support#C-55> <https://ontology.local/support#enforcementLevel> "Soft" .
<https://ontology.local/support#C-55> <https://ontology.local/support#constraintText> "Every Documentation instance describes exactly one Product. Cross-product overview pages legitimately exist, so this flags rather than rejects." .
<https://ontology.local/support#C-55> <https://ontology.local/support#status> "Active" .
<https://ontology.local/support#C-56> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://ontology.local/support#C-56> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://ontology.local/support#Constraint> .
<https://ontology.local/support#C-56> <https://ontology.local/support#constraintId> "C-56" .
<https://ontology.local/support#C-56> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "C-56" .
<https://ontology.local/support#C-56> <https://ontology.local/support#enforcementLevel> "Hard" .
<https://ontology.local/support#C-56> <https://ontology.local/support#constraintText> "Every Ticket has exactly one SLA, determined by its SeverityLevel and Account's SupportEntitlement." .
<https://ontology.local/support#C-56> <https://ontology.local/support#status> "Active" .
<https://ontology.local/support#C-57> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
