<https://ontology.local/support#EQ-02> <https://ontology.local/support#anchorProperty> "sup:Product.usesPlatinumNaming" .
<https://ontology.local/support#EQ-02> <https://ontology.local/support#equivalenceStatus> "Canonical. Which products use Platinum naming is not populated (OQ-07). Interim rule, 2026-08-20: treat Platinum and Premium as synonyms unconditionally — either label resolves to tierCode = PREMIUM regardless of product. Tier counts are correct under this rule; \"which label should this product be showing?\" is not answerable until OQ-07 closes." .
