<https://ontology.local/support#EQ-03> <https://ontology.local/support#equivalenceStatus> "Canonical for the term split. Value-level standard set 2026-08-20 (OQ-19): four levels, S1–S4, uniform across all products, definitions on SeverityLevel. Whether live CRM data conforms is still unverified (OQ-51)." .
